Database migrations for Unicorn.

The database URL comes from app.db (DATABASE_URL in backend/.env), not from
alembic.ini. Run commands from backend/.

Apply migrations:

    uv run python -m app.cli migrate

On Postgres, every migrate run also enables Row Level Security on every table
in the public schema (see env.py), so new tables are covered automatically.

Add a migration after changing app/models.py:

    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the change"

Review the generated file in versions/ before applying it. Autogenerate misses
some changes, such as renamed columns and data migrations.
